OL,3,GNEWSAMan breaks neck in holiday
OL,4,Aswimming pool dive
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is in intensive care in a
OL,7,Fhospital in Turkey after breaking his
OL,8,Fneck while diving into a swimming pool
OL,9,Fon the last day of a holiday.
OL,11,FWill Ponter, from Carnforth in
OL,12,FLancashire, underwent a 13-hour
OL,13,Femergency surgery, and doctors said the
OL,14,F24-year-old would be paralysed from the
OL,15,Fneck down.
OL,17,FHis family are with him in Antalya with
OL,18,Fno timescale yet on when he will be
OL,19,Fstable enough to travel home, following
OL,20,Fthe accident on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
