OL,3,GNEWSAMan breaks neck in holiday
OL,4,Aswimming pool dive
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis partner, Becky Francey, said: "We
OL,7,Fneed to get him home, he's going to
OL,8,Fneed special care. It's going to be a
OL,9,Flong road to recovery."
